Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Apache Arrow Python bindings with Flight support
 Apache Arrow provides columnar data structures and tools for exchanging
 structured data between applications. This package includes its Python
 bindings for arrays, compute, IPC, Acero, datasets, Parquet and Flight.
 .
 The bindings use system Arrow C++ libraries. CUDA, Gandiva, Substrait,
 ORC, HDFS and cloud storage integrations are not built by this recipe.
